  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bringing the local private sector into the municipal deal room for SDGs localization, contributing to the food system and the digital transformation towards SDGs transitions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SDG-Fund project. UNIDO participation at the request of the RCO. The project continues work under the current project 200270, also i mplemented under the SDG-Fund.  The main objective of the project is to incorporate the private sector in the definition and implementation of the sustainable development priorities of four pilot municipalities that are in risk of being left behind, contributing with their experiences, management tools, resources, and knowledge, to turbocharge the sustainable municipal development for SDG achievement, focusing on the food systems and the digital transformation transitions.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Joint SDG Fund</narrative>
  </participating-org>
